<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse closed for Armistice Day.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse closed for Armistice Day.</headline>
<text>
<p>0700 GMT - The Brussels share market is closed Monday for Armistice Day remembrance holiday.</p>
<p>* Bel-20 index  .BFX closed 0.10 percent, or 1.74 points, higher at 1,823.69 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
